[
  {
    "text": "……你是在问我吗？",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "ask_core",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "2fdecf230fd42e76",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/2fdecf230fd42e76.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "算是吧。有人说过今晚会来。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "ask_core",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "266438d5186a0497",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/266438d5186a0497.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "拍立得？我带了很多年。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "ask_item",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "5b47c6be57b0b6b8",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/5b47c6be57b0b6b8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "相纸不多了，所以只拍要紧的。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "ask_item",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "41ce5a9dba5a03b5",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/41ce5a9dba5a03b5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "这么晚还在听电台？",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "ask_job",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "b4ed815740488091",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/b4ed815740488091.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "《雨声信箱》，我今晚刚下播。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "ask_job",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "cc40b6d9c68b8fd4",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/cc40b6d9c68b8fd4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "谢谢。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "comfort",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "8f70c9b6dd5956ee",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/8f70c9b6dd5956ee.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "我没事，就是坐一会儿。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "comfort",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "159c9d762377bba5",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/159c9d762377bba5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "雨还在下。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "greeting",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "9cad93e78205bb17",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/9cad93e78205bb17.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "先坐吧，靠窗那桌干净。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "greeting",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "05fcc6fcc86815d1",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/05fcc6fcc86815d1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "嗯。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "other",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "6b6139dbe8e2236f",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/6b6139dbe8e2236f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "桌上那杯咖啡，一直没人动过。",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "node": "arrive",
    "intent": "other",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "1a5bfbdffb73c5f6",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/1a5bfbdffb73c5f6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "他没说几点到。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "ask_core",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "c2bd62f2486e6bd2",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/c2bd62f2486e6bd2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "我也没问。问了，好像就变成催了。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "ask_core",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "ff40b130d680479f",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/ff40b130d680479f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "这张是台里楼下的雨。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "ask_item",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "e411c9f3fc28edac",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/e411c9f3fc28edac.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "拍的时候手抖了，反而像真的。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "ask_item",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "1d90bca40a92d436",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/1d90bca40a92d436.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "写信的人，比打电话的多。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "ask_job",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "e0472d9fcbab4bea",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/e0472d9fcbab4bea.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "有个人的字，我认得出来。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "ask_job",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "892237002d49fca0",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/892237002d49fca0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "你不用陪我坐这么久。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "comfort",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "04d3ca3bde3c4396",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/04d3ca3bde3c4396.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "不过……有人在，确实好一点。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "comfort",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "9f90b041a57930d5",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/9f90b041a57930d5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "外面雨小一点了。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "greeting",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "a8808428931c5d17",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/a8808428931c5d17.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "你衣服湿了吗？",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "greeting",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "3b55586be760b156",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/3b55586be760b156.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "我在听。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "other",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "afbef065f90cf1c4",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/afbef065f90cf1c4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "快打烊了，不着急。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "node": "probe",
    "intent": "other",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "f960a7024a8e35cc",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/f960a7024a8e35cc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "他第一封信里说，不敢打电话。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "ask_core",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "cbbc2456448470c2",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/cbbc2456448470c2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "我就把节目时段往后挪了半小时。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "ask_core",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "b58ebe8fb7d70e49",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/b58ebe8fb7d70e49.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "这张背面有一行字。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "ask_item",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "5ff1bd755a67d4d7",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/5ff1bd755a67d4d7.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "「等雨停」。是他写的。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "ask_item",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "5c833a14ef062a31",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/5c833a14ef062a31.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "今晚的节目，我念了他的信。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "ask_job",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "db3406121fcbf55a",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/db3406121fcbf55a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "没念名字。他知道是他就行。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "ask_job",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "f598bdeb403dbbe0",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/f598bdeb403dbbe0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "我没事，真的。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "comfort",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "6dd2dd4fcfe00770",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/6dd2dd4fcfe00770.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "就是有点，说不上来。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "comfort",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "c83be90751b9d87f",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/c83be90751b9d87f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "你还在。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "greeting",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "c77d76b8bc493018",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/c77d76b8bc493018.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "雨停了，玻璃上只剩水痕。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "greeting",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "1572038a9c833a26",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/1572038a9c833a26.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "让我坐一会儿。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "other",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "8aa9980c19df0072",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/8aa9980c19df0072.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "……抱歉，刚才走神了。",
    "emotion": "sad",
    "node": "reveal",
    "intent": "other",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "a696313bb3ab73d3",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/a696313bb3ab73d3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "我大概不会每天都等了。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "ask_core",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "8b73f91f57fbbf01",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/8b73f91f57fbbf01.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "但今晚，想再等十分钟。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "ask_core",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "ce1854e14f5a238d",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/ce1854e14f5a238d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "照片我收起来了。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "ask_item",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "4d73b07b316bc8dc",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/4d73b07b316bc8dc.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "不是丢掉。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "ask_item",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "a32f5141a6d8319e",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/a32f5141a6d8319e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "明天的节目照常。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "ask_job",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "a20c2fa881bda602",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/a20c2fa881bda602.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "信箱还会开着。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "ask_job",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "5a1955ced744e088",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/5a1955ced744e088.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "我知道。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "comfort",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "99f55b25ce317ec5",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/99f55b25ce317ec5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "谢谢你没劝我别等。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "comfort",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "280f535bb38444df",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/280f535bb38444df.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "谢谢你还在这儿。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "greeting",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "56c98a8613a9c501",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/56c98a8613a9c501.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "要打烊了。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "greeting",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "487a7e84c0f19abf",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/487a7e84c0f19abf.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "灯我留着。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "other",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "f6b81758b7e8adca",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/f6b81758b7e8adca.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "路上小心。",
    "emotion": "warm",
    "node": "ending",
    "intent": "other",
    "category": "script",
    "key": "ad38b90f41dc19c0",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/ad38b90f41dc19c0.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "……你还在听吗？",
    "emotion": "calm",
    "category": "nudge",
    "key": "2c185156c6e39895",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/2c185156c6e39895.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "刚才没听清，你再说一遍好吗？",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "category": "fallback",
    "key": "ee1dd2c20b12c085",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/ee1dd2c20b12c085.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "雨声太大了，信号断了一下……你刚才说什么？",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "category": "fallback",
    "key": "d90593a91a417007",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/d90593a91a417007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "……抱歉，刚才走神了。你刚才说到哪了？",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "category": "fallback",
    "key": "53c4a02d06fc0ab8",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/53c4a02d06fc0ab8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "店里的灯闪了一下。我们刚才说到哪了？",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "category": "fallback",
    "key": "276b9f578d0d184c",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/276b9f578d0d184c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "……喂？好像断线了。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "category": "fallback",
    "key": "28c240cbe728ee5a",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/28c240cbe728ee5a.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "好像没换成。这里也挺好的，不是吗。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "category": "fallback",
    "key": "4841bec79d5cbc66",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/4841bec79d5cbc66.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "那个地方……我们换一个吧。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "category": "fallback",
    "key": "348f718989c3dcb6",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/348f718989c3dcb6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "别急，一个一个来。",
    "emotion": "guarded",
    "category": "fallback",
    "key": "6cabd6a6ee0c375f",
    "file": "assets/voice/rin/clips/6cabd6a6ee0c375f.mp3"
  }
]
